{"unit_id":"xiaoshihou514__dsh-desktop-pet#card-zh","repo":"xiaoshihou514/dsh-desktop-pet","commit":"5f0060620d3b25c37c1d725af877f78708672ef5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"大肥鱼（DSH Desktop Pet）是 Linux 和 Windows 桌面宠物，以置顶透明窗口显示鲸鱼娘，并通过本机 whale-girl API 同步 DSH 状态。它展示思考、工作、审批等待、完成和会话活动；用户可拖动宠物、喂食或玩耍，也能从托盘显示、隐藏或退出。宠物还会游走、休眠、反馈升级并记住窗口位置。需先运行提供 whale-girl API 的 DSH 服务，默认连接本机 127.0.0.1:3080，可用 DSH_URL 指定地址。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/main.cjs:46-48","src/main.cjs:79-112","src/renderer/renderer.js:413-436","src/renderer/renderer.js:606-672"]}
{"unit_id":"xiaoshihou514__dsh-desktop-pet#card-en","repo":"xiaoshihou514/dsh-desktop-pet","commit":"5f0060620d3b25c37c1d725af877f78708672ef5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Desktop Pet shows the whale-girl pet in an always-on-top window on Linux and Windows. It reflects DSH activity and session approval waits; users can drag, feed, or play with it. It requires the local whale-girl API; DSH_URL sets its loopback address.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/main.cjs:46-48","src/main.cjs:79-112","src/renderer/renderer.js:413-436","src/renderer/renderer.js:606-672"]}
